# Riverglades (40-41): the Horde quests of Rog'mar, Sunnyglade and Bolder'ok, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/riverglades_40_41.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Riverglades, area 16591).
# The guide's quest list is section 1 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the higher
# Riverglades quests (the docks, Twilight's Shroud, the later Bloodmaster's Ring fights) are in
# Riverglades (44-45).
# Left out: Key Ingredients (94974): it follows Krol'dok Moulding, a quest item dropped by Tunk in
# the Krol'dok Stronghold dungeon.
# Data fixed here: Food for the Taking (93787) has no prerequisite (the data says A Message in
# Blood; outof.games and the quest giver offer both at once).
#
# The route: Rog'mar, then a flight to Undercity (Armory of Sunnyglade, the auction house, level 40
# training) and the hearthstone back; the plains south-east of Rog'mar; a long loop west (Meadowsbrook,
# Turner's Logging Camp, the Cinderscale cave, the Bristle Hills); the river and Farholde; Sunnyglade
# twice; Bolder'ok and the Bloodmaster's Ring; the goblin docks; back to Undercity to finish.

guide Riverglades (40-41)
faction horde
levels 40 41
carry 1137 1420 95141 95143
leave 1137 1420
next Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43)

map Riverglades

# Rog'mar -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride to Rog'mar, the Horde outpost of the Riverglades, northeast of Stonard" at 59.0,45.6 r 40
turnin 95143
tip Tan'jani stands indoors.
accept 95951
turnin 95141
accept 93786
accept 93787 nopre
accept 93788
accept 95992
tip Ghostmaw is a level 42 elite white crocolisk that swims up and down the river; you will cross his path often.
accept 96107
bind 256675
fpath 255993

# Undercity: the start of Armory of Sunnyglade, the auction house, training -------------------------

fly "Undercity, Tirisfal" npc 255993
map Undercity
accept 97884
tip Mirelle Tremayne is a heavy armor merchant.
ah 96026.1 npc 8672
tip The ogre Hamur in Bolder'ok wants them later. Blacksmiths make them too.
train 4593 260093 4582 4606 4566 4563
tip Hunters, shamans and druids have no trainer here: train at your next visit to Orgrimmar or Thunder Bluff.
hearth npc 256675

