do 96108 bg
do 96104 at 61.6,61.5
do 96108
turnin 96108 96104
accept 96109 96105
do 96109 bg
do 96105
tip Use the Tallstrider Call among the lions to bring out Ombassa, a level 41 pride leader.
do 96109
turnin 96109 96105
accept 94532 94533
accept 94535
